     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ActorDefinition OrderPlacer</b></p><a name=\"OrderPlacer\"> </a><a name=\"hcOrderPlacer\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Actor: OrderPlacer </b></td><td>Order Placer</td><td>Type: system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>On an Order Server, the placer decides whether an order is actionable, either by tagging the MedicationRequest or by creating a Task that points at it. When a Task coordinates the work, the placer also closes the MedicationRequest once the Task is completed.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
