  fhir:documentation [ fhir:v "On an Order Server, the placer decides whether an order is actionable, either by tagging the MedicationRequest or by creating a Task that points at it. When a Task coordinates the work, the placer also closes the MedicationRequest once the Task is completed."] . # 

